---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Building IT"
  description="Building IT's privacy policy: what information we collect, how we use and share it, your rights and choices, and our SMS/text messaging program terms."
  noindex
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main">
    <section class="legal-header">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {SITE.legalUpdated}</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap legal-content">
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          {SITE.name} ("Company," "we," "us," or "our") is a business based in Kankakee, Illinois. This
          Privacy Policy explains what information we collect when you visit our website, contact us,
          or become a client, how we use and share that information, and the choices available to you.
          By using our website or services, you agree to the practices described in this policy.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect the following categories of information:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Information you provide directly</strong> — such as your name, business name, phone
            number, email address, and any details you share through our contact form, by phone, by email,
            or when you sign up for our managed website service.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Information collected automatically</strong> — such as your IP address, browser type,
            device information, and pages visited, collected when you use our website.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Information related to our services</strong> — such as the business details, branding,
            photos, and content you provide so we can build, host, and maintain your website.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Respond to inquiries and prepare quotes for our managed website service;</li>
          <li>
            Build, host, maintain, and update the website described in your service agreement;
          </li>
          <li>Send service-related communications, invoices, and account notices;</li>
          <li>
            With your consent, send appointment reminders, project updates, or other updates by text
            message;
          </li>
          <li>Improve our website, offerings, and customer experience; and</li>
          <li>Comply with legal, regulatory, or contractual obligations.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. SMS/Text Messaging Communications</h2>
        <p>
          If you provide your mobile phone number and opt in to receive text messages from us —
          whether through our website contact form, over the phone, or in a signed service agreement
          — you consent to receive text messages related to appointment reminders, project updates,
          website launch notifications, billing/account notices, and other service-related
          communications. Consent to receive text messages is not a condition of purchasing any
          service.
        </p>
        <div class="legal-callout">
          <p>Text Messaging Terms:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Message frequency varies based on your account and project activity.</li>
            <li>Message and data rates may apply.</li>
            <li>
              Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to opt out of receiving text messages from us.
            </li>
            <li>
              Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or contact us at
              <a href={SITE.phoneHref}>{SITE.phoneDisplay}</a> or
              <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
            </li>
            <li>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
            <li>
              <strong
                >We do not sell or share your mobile information or SMS opt-in consent with third
                parties for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong
              > This information is used solely to deliver the text messaging program described above.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h2>5. How We Share Your Information</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share information with:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Service providers</strong> who help us operate our business (such as hosting, domain
            registration, and website infrastructure providers), bound by confidentiality obligations;
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Legal and regulatory authorities</strong> when required by law, subpoena, or to protect
            our rights, property, or safety;
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>A successor entity</strong> in the event of a sale of business assets; and
          </li>
          <li><strong>Other parties</strong> only with your consent.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          As stated above, mobile information and SMS opt-in consent are never sold or shared with
          third parties for their own marketing or promotional purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to understand how visitors use our
          site and to improve our content. You can control or disable cookies through your browser
          settings; disabling cookies may affect some site functionality. Our website does not
          currently respond to browser "Do Not Track" signals.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          We retain personal information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes described
          in this policy, maintain our business records, and comply with legal, tax, or contractual
          obligations — typically for as long as you remain a customer, and for a reasonable period
          afterward (generally up to 7 years) to comply with those obligations.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
        <p>
          You may have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of your personal
          information. To exercise any of these rights, or to:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Opt out of marketing emails, use the unsubscribe link in any email we send;</li>
          <li>Opt out of text messages, reply STOP to any message or contact us directly; and</li>
          <li>
            Ask a question about your data, contact us using the information in Section 13 below.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our website and services are intended for businesses and are not directed to individuals
          under 13 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We maintain reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards designed to
          protect personal information against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or
          destruction. No method of transmission or storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee
          absolute security.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the
          privacy practices or content of those sites, and we encourage you to review their privacy
          policies before providing any information.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page
          with an updated effective date. Your continued use of our website or services after
          changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.
        </p>

        <h2>13. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your information, contact
          us at:
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>{SITE.name}</strong><br />
          {SITE.location}<br />
          Phone: <a href={SITE.phoneHref}>{SITE.phoneDisplay}</a><br />
          Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
